00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:06,000
In the 1980s, a drummer is abandoned by his band just
before they become rock superstars.

4
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:46,000
Twenty years later, the drummer sees his second chance at stardom arise when he is
asked to perform with his teenage nephew's high school rock band.

