11
01:02:20,000 --> 01:02:26,000
The Rocker is a 2008 American comedy film directed by Peter Cattaneo and written
by Maya Forbes and Wallace Wolodarsky, from a story by Ryan Jaffe.

12
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
The film stars Rainn Wilson as a failed musician who goes on tour with
his nephew's band after one of their songs goes viral.

13
01:13:40,000 --> 01:13:46,000
Christina Applegate, Jeff Garlin, Josh Gad, Teddy
Geiger and Emma Stone also star.

14
01:19:20,000 --> 01:19:26,000
The Rocker was released on August 20, 2008, and
received mixed reviews from critics.

15
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
It grossed $7 million against a $15 million budget.

16
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:46,000
The film explores themes of rock 'n' roll, 1970s, drums, groupie, heavy metal.

17
01:36:20,000 --> 01:36:26,000
The tone is lighthearted.
